{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:059bfe04c50d1763","name":"Deck Sweeper","source":{"id":"source:reference-059bfe04c50d1763","title":"Deck Sweeper","revision":19640,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:20:15Z","sha256":"77c35630de7d350f498569503da6d90f6b74974869b76c58fd4774da23ca4b8f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19640","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Deck%20Sweeper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-059bfe04c50d1763","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Merr-Sonn Deck Sweeper Blaster is designed to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," large numbers of people at once, typically in the confined space of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," interior (hence the name). Unlike normal blaster weapons, a Deck Sweeper only fires on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," setting as it has no lethal setting. A Deck Sweeper differs from other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"}," in that it targets all creatures or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," within a 6-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"}," as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},". The wielder makes a single attack roll and compares the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of all targets within the area. A hit deals normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage, while a miss deals half ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage, following the normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage rules.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," on the same turn to prime the Deck Sweeper before you make your attack. Otherwise, the weapon will not fire. A Deck Sweeper requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 5 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES (Only, 3d6)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 4.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
